1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Real or fake work-from-home job post? Here's how to tell in ten seconds.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Fake: a phone number and DM me. Real: it's on the company's careers page.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,500
Fake: you pay for training or equipment. Real jobs pay you.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,500
Fake: they move you to WhatsApp or Telegram.

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,500
The FTC got about twenty thousand task-scam reports in just the first half of 2024.

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,000
Send this to someone job hunting right now.
